---- MODULE EvSets ----
EXTENDS Integers, Sequences, FiniteSets, TLC
ASSUME PrintT({1, 2} \cup {2, 3})
ASSUME PrintT({1, 2, 3} \cap {2, 3, 4})
ASSUME PrintT({1, 2, 3} \ {2})
ASSUME PrintT(SUBSET {1, 2})
